Package: yuoop-downloader
Version: 1.2.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ffmpeg, python3-tk, libxcb1
Maintainer: Yuoop Contributors <info@yuoop.org>
Description: High-performance YouTube playlist and video downloader
 Yuoop Downloader is a polished desktop application for analyzing, queuing,
 and downloading YouTube playlists, videos, mixes, and channels.
 Includes built-in media preview and audio conversion options.
